  s_start --> normalize
  normalize --> list_screen
  list_screen --> d_hit
  d_hit -->|No hit| clear_out
  d_hit -->|Possible| fuzzy
  fuzzy --> analyst
  analyst --> d_true
  d_true -->|False positive| clear_out
  d_true -- Confirmed --x escalate

